    id: "20260915-12260",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Linux",
    title: "Sound Open Firmware 2.15 發布，強化記憶體保護並支援 AMD ACP 7.x 與 Intel UAOL",
    summary: "Sound Open Firmware (SOF) 釋出 2.15 版本，作為一個開源、廠商獨立的音訊 DSP 韌體堆疊與驅動框架。本次更新的主要重點是大幅提升系統安全性，引入了使用者空間（user-space）的記憶體保護模組執行支援，並強化了 MMU 保護機制，旨在防止有缺陷或行為異常的模組破壞核心記憶體或其他模組的記憶體。SOF 2.15 支援新的硬體平台，包括 AMD ACP 7.x（預計用於未來 AMD Zen 6 架構的桌上型/筆電設計）和 NXP i.MX8MP Cortex-M7。此外，還加入了 Intel USB Audio Offload Link (UAOL) 的支援，使 DSP 能夠直接處理 USB 音訊，減輕主機 CPU 負載。開發團隊也新增了 QEMU Xtensa 目標和 POSIX/libFuzzer 模糊測試平台，以進一步加固程式碼。新版本還增加了 Phase Vocoder、STFT Process 等多個音訊處理模組。",
    tags: ["Sound Open Firmware", "SOF 2.15", "AMD ACP 7.x", "Intel UAOL", "DSP 韌體", "記憶體保護"],
    title_en: "Sound Open Firmware 2.15 Released, Enhancing Memory Protection and Supporting AMD ACP 7.x and Intel UAOL",
    summary_en: "Sound Open Firmware (SOF) has released version 2.15, an open-source, vendor-independent audio DSP firmware stack and driver framework. The main focus of this update is significantly enhancing system security by introducing support for user-space memory protection module execution and strengthening the MMU protection mechanism. This aims to prevent faulty or abnormally behaving modules from corrupting core memory or the memory of other modules. SOF 2.15 supports new hardware platforms, including AMD ACP 7.x (expected for future AMD Zen 6 desktop/laptop designs) and NXP i.MX8MP Cortex-M7. Additionally, it adds support for Intel USB Audio Offload Link (UAOL), allowing the DSP to directly handle USB audio and reduce the host CPU load. The development team also added QEMU Xtensa targets and a POSIX/libFuzzer fuzz testing platform to further harden the code. The new version also includes multiple audio processing modules such as Phase Vocoder and STFT Process.",
    tags_en: ["Sound Open Firmware", "SOF 2.15", "AMD ACP 7.x", "Intel UAOL", "DSP Firmware", "Memory Protection"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Sound-Open-Firmware-2.15", lang: "EN" }
    ]
