    title: "Raspberry Pi OS 桌面大幅更新：引入圖示 Dock 與全新使用者介面體驗",
    summary: "Raspberry Pi OS 的桌面環境進行了重大更新與現代化改造，旨在提升在 ARM64 單板電腦上的桌面計算體驗。本次更新主要在使用者介面（UI/UX）層面進行了大幅改進。新版本預設引入了圖示 Dock，可作為現有工作列的補充或替代。此外，原有的主選單小工具已被一個圖形化的應用程式啟動器畫面取代。除了這些核心改動外，新桌面還具備了新的任務列表、更豐富的 Dock 與桌面客製化選項，以及優化後的螢幕截圖功能。這些更新屬於作業系統的介面與功能升級，而非針對特定安全漏洞的修補。建議使用者查閱 RaspberryPi.com 獲取最新資訊與詳細操作指南。",
    tags: ["Raspberry Pi OS", "Linux", "UI/UX", "ARM64", "桌面環境"],
    title_en: "Major Desktop Update for Raspberry Pi OS: Introducing Icon Dock and a Brand New User Interface Experience",
    summary_en: "The desktop environment for Raspberry Pi OS has undergone a major update and modernization, aimed at enhancing the desktop computing experience on ARM64 single-board computers. This update primarily involves significant improvements to the User Interface (UI/UX) layer. The new version defaults to an icon Dock, which can supplement or replace the existing taskbar. Furthermore, the original main menu widget has been replaced by a graphical application launcher screen. Beyond these core changes, the new desktop features a new task list, richer Dock and desktop customization options, and an optimized screenshot function. These updates constitute an interface and functional upgrade to the operating system, rather than a patch for a specific security vulnerability. Users are advised to check RaspberryPi.com for the latest information and detailed guides.",
