    category: "Windows",
    title: "CrowdStrike 警告：Windows Falcon 偵測器存在權限提升漏洞，建議立即更新",
    summary: "CrowdStrike 發布安全更新，修補其 Falcon 偵測器在 Windows 環境下的漏洞。此漏洞僅在啟用「Microsoft Office File Malicious Macro Removal Windows」策略設定，且客戶透過「Cloud Anti-malware for Microsoft Office Files」功能保護時存在。該漏洞允許攻擊者從未授權的環境（unprivileged context）寫入任意檔案到受保護位置，可能導致本地權限提升（local privilege escalation）。受影響的產品包括 Falcon 偵測器（適用於版本 7.34 及以上、7.32 LTS，以及 Windows 7/2008 R2 系統的 7.16 版本），以及基於 Falcon 偵測器功能的 CrowdStrike Laroux Malware Cleanup Tool。CrowdStrike 建議用戶立即更新所有受影響的組件，以確保系統安全。Mac、Linux 和舊版系統的 Falcon 偵測器則不受影響。",
    tags: ["CrowdStrike", "Falcon sensor", "Windows", "本地權限提升", "安全更新", "Microsoft Office"],
    title_en: "CrowdStrike Warning: Windows Falcon Sensor Contains Privilege Escalation Vulnerability, Immediate Update Recommended",
    summary_en: "CrowdStrike has released a security update to patch a vulnerability in its Falcon sensor operating within Windows environments. This vulnerability exists only when the 'Microsoft Office File Malicious Macro Removal Windows' policy setting is enabled, and the customer is utilizing the 'Cloud Anti-malware for Microsoft Office Files' feature. The vulnerability allows an attacker to write arbitrary files to a protected location from an unprivileged context, potentially leading to local privilege escalation. Affected products include the Falcon sensor (applicable to versions 7.34 and above, 7.32 LTS, and version 7.16 on Windows 7/2008 R2 systems), and the CrowdStrike Laroux Malware Cleanup Tool, which relies on the Falcon sensor functionality. CrowdStrike advises users to immediately update all affected components to ensure system security. Falcon sensors on Mac, Linux, and older operating systems are not affected.",
