    title: "LiteSpeed Web Server Enterprise 關鍵漏洞：低權限網站用戶可提升至 root 權限",
    summary: "cPanel 在 9 月 14 日發布公告，警告 LiteSpeed Web Server Enterprise 存在一個關鍵漏洞。此漏洞可能允許共享主機環境中的低權限網站用戶，透過利用該缺陷，提升至 root 權限，進而存取或修改同一伺服器上其他網站的資料，甚至控制整個伺服器。該漏洞影響所有版本低於 6.3.7 的系統。cPanel 強烈建議管理員立即升級至 6.3.7 版本。雖然 LiteSpeed 宣布了 6.3.7 包含「安全改進」，但官方並未公開說明具體修復了哪一個權限提升漏洞。由於此漏洞尚未公開 CVE 編號或 CVSS 分數，且目前未有明確的修補工作流程，管理員應特別注意手動執行升級指令：/usr/local/lsws/admin/misc/lsup.sh -f -v 6.3.7，以確保系統能及時修補。",
    tags: ["LiteSpeed Web Server Enterprise", "cPanel", "root 權限提升", "共享主機", "CVE", "權限提升漏洞"],
    title_en: "LiteSpeed Web Server Enterprise Critical Vulnerability: Low-Privilege Website Users Can Elevate to Root Privileges",
    summary_en: "cPanel issued an announcement on September 14th, warning of a critical vulnerability in LiteSpeed Web Server Enterprise. This vulnerability could potentially allow low-privilege website users in a shared hosting environment to exploit the flaw, elevate their privileges to root, and subsequently access or modify data belonging to other websites on the same server, or even gain control of the entire server. The vulnerability affects all versions prior to 6.3.7. cPanel strongly advises administrators to immediately upgrade to version 6.3.7. Although LiteSpeed announced that 6.3.7 includes a \"security improvement,\" the official source has not disclosed which specific privilege escalation vulnerability was patched. Since this vulnerability has not yet been assigned a CVE ID or CVSS score, and there is no clear remediation workflow available, administrators should pay special attention to manually executing the upgrade command: /usr/local/lsws/admin/misc/lsup.sh -f -v 6.3.7, to ensure timely system patching.",
