    title: "Apple 將 2019 年 21.5 吋 iMac (Retina 4K) 列入「古董產品」清單",
    summary: "Apple 公司更新了其古董與淘汰產品清單，將 2019 年的 21.5 吋 iMac (Retina 4K) 加入其中。Apple 會維護這份清單，讓用戶了解較舊的設備是否仍有資格獲得硬體服務和更換零件。公司定義產品為「古董」（vintage），是指產品已下市超過五年但未滿七年；若超過七年則可能被列為「淘汰」（obsolete）。一旦產品被列為淘汰，Apple 和授權服務商通常會停止提供硬體服務，且零件無法訂購。雖然將此 iMac 列為古董產品，表示它仍可能符合硬體服務和零件的資格，但實際服務和零件的提供仍取決於供應情況。文章提醒擁有此機型的用戶，若有待修復的需求，應盡快尋求維修。",
    tags: ["Apple", "iMac", "Retina 4K", "古董產品", "硬體服務"],
    title_en: "Apple Lists 2019 21.5-inch iMac (Retina 4K) as 'Vintage' Product",
    summary_en: "Apple has updated its list of vintage and discontinued products, adding the 2019 21.5-inch iMac (Retina 4K). Apple maintains this list to help users understand whether older equipment is still eligible for hardware services and replacement parts. The company defines a product as 'vintage' if it has been discontinued for more than five years but less than seven years; if it exceeds seven years, it may be classified as 'obsolete.' Once a product is classified as obsolete, Apple and authorized service providers typically cease offering hardware services, and parts become unavailable. While listing this iMac as a vintage product suggests it may still qualify for hardware service and parts, the actual provision of service and parts depends on availability. The article reminds owners of this model that if repairs are needed, they should seek service promptly.",
