    title: "watchOS 27 推出 Siri App，Apple Watch 聊天紀錄功能仍需特定操作才能接續對話",
    summary: "Apple 在 watchOS 27 版本中更新了 Siri App，讓使用者首次具備儲存聊天紀錄的功能。這項功能讓用戶可以輕鬆參考先前查詢的內容，並能像使用 iMessage 聊天串一樣，自然地接續與 Siri 的對話，提升了互動的流暢性。雖然 iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 上的 Siri App 體驗更直覺，但在 Apple Watch 上，Siri App 雖然會顯示聊天紀錄，但缺乏明顯的介面來直接接續對話。目前在 Apple Watch 上接續聊天紀錄的技巧是：在 Siri App 內開啟聊天串後，再透過長按 Digital Crown 或呼叫 Siri/Hey Siri 來啟動，Siri 才會將新的輸入附加到該聊天串中。Apple 提醒，這可能在未來版本的 watchOS 27 中會有更優化的操作方式。watchOS 27 與 iOS 27 同時發布，但 Siri AI 功能需符合特定硬體和市場要求，並可能需要等待。Apple Watch Series 12 和 Apple Watch Ultra 4 將於 9 月 18 日發售。",
    tags: ["watchOS 27", "Siri App", "Apple Watch", "iOS 27", "聊天紀錄"],
    title_en: "watchOS 27 Introduces Siri App, Apple Watch Chat History Feature Still Requires Specific Actions to Continue Conversation",
    summary_en: "Apple has updated the Siri App in watchOS 27, allowing users to save chat history for the first time. This feature enables users to easily reference previous queries and continue conversations with Siri naturally, similar to using an iMessage thread, thereby improving interaction fluidity. While the Siri App experience on iPhone, iPad, and Mac is more intuitive, the Siri App on Apple Watch displays chat history but lacks an obvious interface for directly continuing the conversation. Currently, the technique to continue a chat history on Apple Watch is: after opening a chat thread within the Siri App, the user must then initiate the continuation by long-pressing the Digital Crown or calling Siri/Hey Siri, which prompts Siri to append the new input to that chat thread. Apple noted that this may feature more optimized operational methods in future versions of watchOS 27. watchOS 27 and iOS 27 will be released simultaneously, but the Siri AI functionality must meet specific hardware and market requirements and may require waiting. The Apple Watch Series 12 and Apple Watch Ultra 4 are scheduled for release on September 18th.",
