    summary: "Apple 在 watchOS 27 版本中移除了先前在 Apple Watch Series 11、Ultra 3 和 SE 3 等型號上可用的「雙擊數位錶冠」多工切換快捷手勢。此手勢原本用於快速在當前應用程式與先前使用的應用程式之間切換，或在錶面與上次查看的應用程式間跳轉，極大地提升了操作效率。Apple 表示移除此手勢的原因，是為了為新一代 Apple Watch Series 12 和 Ultra 4 引入的「Live Rewind」功能騰出空間。Live Rewind 是「語音智慧 (Audio Intelligence)」功能套件的一部分，能提供一段 15 秒的語音文字稿。在新的 Apple Watch 上，觸發 Live Rewind 的方式就是透過雙擊數位錶冠。因此，舊款 Apple Watch 在 watchOS 27 上將無法使用此快捷手勢，這讓部分用戶感到不便，因為目前替代方案僅是開啟動態應用程式網格。用戶應關注未來 watchOS 的更新，期待 Apple 能提供更完善的替代操作方式。",
    tags: ["watchOS 27", "Apple Watch", "數位錶冠", "Live Rewind", "Apple Watch Series 12", "多工切換"],
    title_en: "watchOS 27 removes Digital Crown double-click gesture to accommodate Live Rewind feature for Apple Watch Series 12",
    summary_en: "Apple has removed the 'Digital Crown double-click' gesture, which was previously available on models such as the Apple Watch Series 11, Ultra 3, and SE 3, in watchOS 27. This gesture was previously used to quickly switch between the current application and the previously used application, or to jump between the watch face and the last viewed application, significantly improving operational efficiency. Apple stated that the reason for removing this gesture is to free up space for the 'Live Rewind' feature, which is being introduced with the next generation Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4. Live Rewind is part of the 'Audio Intelligence' feature suite and provides a 15-second audio transcript. On the new Apple Watch, the method to trigger Live Rewind is by double-clicking the Digital Crown. Therefore, older Apple Watches will be unable to use this shortcut gesture on watchOS 27, which some users find inconvenient, as the current alternative is only opening the dynamic app grid. Users should monitor future watchOS updates and anticipate Apple providing a more comprehensive alternative method of operation.",
