    summary_en: "Apple is bringing several powerful upgrades to the iPhone Camera App in iOS 27. Key highlights include the brand-new \"Siri Mode,\" which integrates visual intelligence capabilities into the Camera App. This allows users to perform functions such as real-time foreign language translation via photo, adding event flyer details to the calendar, or retrieving plant care information. Furthermore, iOS 27 allows users to customize and optimize the control panel across various Camera App modes (such as Photo, Video, and Portrait) using the \"Edit\" function, enabling them to remove unused buttons and add frequently used features. Users of the iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max will benefit from exclusive \"Pro Controls,\" which introduce professional options like lens aperture, shutter speed, white balance, and histogram viewing. Additionally, iOS 27 upgrades \"Photographic Styles 3\" and adds the \"Apple Reference Image\" feature, allowing users to capture and share reference images similar to \"digital negatives\" to verify the original content captured by the camera. These updates significantly enhance the Camera App's versatility and professional control capabilities.",
