    category: "前瞻技術",
    title: "IoT資安新創 Exein 募資 2.7 億美元，專攻「實體 AI」安全架構",
    summary: "義大利的 IoT 資安新創公司 Exein 宣布完成一輪超額認購的募資，募集 2.7 億美元，使其總募資額超過 6 億美元，估值達到 17 億美元。Exein 專精於嵌入式和運行時安全技術，旨在解決物聯網設備的漏洞、攻擊和合規問題。其解決方案提供威脅監控、偵測和遏制，並結合了核心層級的預防性運行時安全，能在攻擊執行前進行阻擋。面對 AI 正在從雲端走向實體世界的趨勢，Exein 正在開發專為「實體 AI 安全」設計的專有基礎模型。該公司表示，新的 Agentic 安全架構將驅動自主代理，以機器速度保護系統，從而應對攻擊速度日益加快的挑戰。",
    tags: ["Exein", "IoT資安", "實體 AI", "Agentic AI", "嵌入式安全", "物聯網"],
    title_en: "IoT Cybersecurity Startup Exein Raises $270 Million, Focusing on 'Physical AI' Security Architecture",
    summary_en: "Italian IoT cybersecurity startup Exein announced the completion of an oversubscribed funding round, raising $270 million. This brings its total funding to over $600 million, valuing the company at $1.7 billion. Exein specializes in embedded and runtime security technologies, aiming to address vulnerabilities, attacks, and compliance issues in IoT devices. Its solutions provide threat monitoring, detection, and containment, incorporating core-level preventative runtime security that can block attacks before they execute. Facing the trend of AI moving from the cloud to the physical world, Exein is developing a proprietary foundational model designed specifically for 'Physical AI Security.' The company stated that its new Agentic security architecture will drive autonomous agents to protect systems at machine speed, thereby addressing the challenge of increasingly rapid attack speeds.",
    tags_en: ["Exein", "IoT Cybersecurity", "Physical AI", "Agentic AI", "Embedded Security", "IoT"],
    sources: [
      { name: "SecurityWeek", url: "https://securityweek.com/exein-secures-270m-at-1-7b-valuation-for-physical-ai-security", lang: "EN" }
    ]
