    summary: "General Motors (GM) 在針對 2027 年 Chevrolet Silverado 和 GMC Sierra 的最新軟體更新中，找到了整合 Android Auto 和 Apple CarPlay 的「最佳平衡點」。此前，GM 曾宣布移除車載手機投影系統，轉向原生 Android Automotive 系統，此舉曾引起消費者不滿。本次更新的關鍵改變是，兩款車型將支援 Android Auto 和 CarPlay，但採用一種新的「視窗化模式」。此模式讓手機投影內容出現在顯示器的一部分，而原生車載資訊系統的元素則環繞在側面，使用者無需完全切換介面，仍能輕鬆控制車輛功能。GM 產品經理 Colin McCormick 稱這是「最佳平衡點」，旨在讓客戶無需在「使用投影」和「使用原生系統」之間做出選擇。然而，文章指出，目前尚無消息確認 GM 是否會將此功能擴展到更多車型，特別是電動車（EV）仍缺乏手機投影支援。",
    tags: ["GM", "Android Auto", "Apple CarPlay", "Android Automotive", "2027 Chevrolet Silverado", "2027 GMC Sierra"],
    title_en: "GM announces 2027 models will feature Android Auto and Apple CarPlay using a new windowed integration mode",
    summary_en: "In a recent software update for the 2027 Chevrolet Silverado and GMC Sierra, General Motors (GM) has found a \"sweet spot\" for integrating Android Auto and Apple CarPlay. Previously, GM had announced the removal of in-car phone projection systems in favor of a native Android Automotive system, a move that drew consumer dissatisfaction. The key change in this update is that both models will support Android Auto and CarPlay, but using a new \"windowed mode.\" This mode displays phone projection content within a portion of the screen, while native in-vehicle information system elements surround it on the sides. This allows users to easily control vehicle functions without completely switching interfaces. GM Product Manager Colin McCormick called this the \"sweet spot,\" aiming to eliminate the choice customers face between \"using projection\" and \"using the native system.\" However, the article notes that there is currently no confirmation of whether GM will extend this feature to more models, particularly as electric vehicles (EVs) still lack phone projection support.",
    tags_en: ["GM", "Android Auto", "Apple CarPlay", "Android Automotive", "2027 Chevrolet Silverado", "2027 GMC Sierra"],
